      "text": "All thy mys-ter-ies are be-yond com-pre-hen---sion; all are ex-ceed-ing-ly glo-ri-ous, O The-o-to------kos. Sealed with pu-ri-ty and pre-served in vir-gin--i-ty, thou wast known to be a true moth-er, giv-ing birth un-to the true__ God. Do thou en-treat Him that our souls be saved.___"
